{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_01",
  "title": "Dream of the Lattice Window",
  "storyCode": "SS-1",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9b26d290fb71fe9e27da0aeb5484c7f52b3dbba75fbce354484b1203aa77b307",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=2>9:37 P.M.</> <p=1>A Remote Victorian Town</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're four whole hours behind schedule..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We don't have much time left until midnight..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bena",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The streets are deserted. We're not finding a map in a place like this either... This is a rotten turn."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We should split up. We have our communicators. If anyone finds anything, page the rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bena",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not a bad idea..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, okay, that works for us, but..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You don't have any solo experience, Sakiko. I can't let you go alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now is hardly the time for that, is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You heard what she wrote. 'This will be my final letter.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In the worst-case scenario, she's..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Vigna. I'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "By Miss Whislash's account, I'm ready to operate in a squad based on my current abilities, remember?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Takes out communicator) And I'll call at the first sign of trouble. Is that satisfactory?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bena",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Good! And don't forget us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Fine. Just be careful, yeah?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will. Miss Iris, what's her name and address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Her name is Ann... address, 33 Garden Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Acknowledged. We'll start from this crossroad. Split up and let's begin!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*pant* *pant* How can these streets be so complicated?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is someone selling... flowers there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Why would someone be selling flowers at this hour...?\nNo, no matter. I need a lead!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse me—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Excuse me, do you know where Garden Street is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Florist Lady",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1255_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're on it. Would you like a flower, Miss?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No. No, thank you... Would you happen to know which way number 33 is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Florist Lady",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1255_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look up, and follow the setting sun towards the west. Last house at the end of the street, that's number 33."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Madam, it's already night..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Florist Lady",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1255_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, that's why I didn't hear any footsteps in the streets... Silly me, doddering about. Suppose it's time I went home."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is your sight...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Florist Lady",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1255_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't you worry about me. Got somewhere to go, don't you? Better go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Florist Lady",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1255_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The nights are dark here. Now don't you get lost again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank you... you be safe, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>33 Garden Street</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Towards the west... This is the place she meant, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The old door creaks as Sakiko pushes it open."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ugh... it reeks of alcohol in here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ground is covered in muddy shoeprints. In the corner, there stands a ragged man.\nHe looks all around, then starts going through bottles tidily tucked away in the corner, picking up each one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Empty..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Empty..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...All empty!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Anna! Anna!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where the hell are you?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*whimper* Is that it? You're abandoning me, running away, JUST LIKE SHE DID?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gh... Anna... Anna..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I won't drink anymore! I swear! Starting today, I'll do my best!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The man collapses to his knees in agony, then promptly screams in pain.\nHis palm is pierced by a shard of the bottle he broke."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A-Anna...! There's blood... on the floor... I'm bleeding!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm dying! Come back, Anna! I'm dying!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Anna... you're back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not Anna."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You are... you are!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Drunken Man",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's me! Don't you remember me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The man makes to crawl towards Sakiko, but lets out another scream.\nInexplicably, a wave of lamentation washes through Sakiko.\nShe places her hand on the battered door frame—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ragged Girl",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ragged Girl",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's go."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibchurch"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So the story you never published... that was an account of what really happened to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I do love fairytales. Back when Mum was still around, she bought me heaps and heaps of storybooks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We were happy back then. Me, and Mum... and Dad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the happiness left with Mum."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I tried to write about all I'd gone through, show it to others, but nobody wants to read about oppression and despair."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So I turned every sentence on its head. I let them become the most beautiful fairytales of all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...But I stopped reading fairytales long ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Anna..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Trembles)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "P-Please don't call me by that name..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I'm sorry. I didn't mean to hurt you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry. You've already been much kinder to me than anyone else."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's Iris, actually. She's worried about you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know Iris?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I do. I came with her to find you. I just gave her a call, and she's right on her way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Iris..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You don't want to see her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know how busy she is. Every day, she has so much to take care of..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're a very important friend to her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know... I was up on a high place today. And I kept standing up, and looking down..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I had all the letters she wrote to me in my pocket. I kept every last one. And I just kept holding onto them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She told me to keep living. That the sweet dreams of my fairytales would come about someday."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know if I should trust myself, or trust her..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can absolutely trust her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's a real fairy, after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fairy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You'll understand as soon as she's here. She says before you become an adult—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko looks up at the clock.\nIt's an antique one, hung high on the wall, and the hour and minute hands are slowly converging upon each other."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dammit..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Iris was saying, before you become an adult..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mean, before my birthday? Iris wants to celebrate my birthday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, and we're running out of time..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's alright, I haven't celebrated my birthday in so long anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not a child anymore. When you're grown up, you don't need celebration."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko's gaze flits around, and something catches her eye."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ann. How about I give you your birthday's blessings?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It is a piano.\nThe moon shines upon it, as though it was put there just for tonight.\nEven if Iris's sweet dream doesn't make it in time, Sakiko wants to do <i>something</i> for Ann."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In your last moments before you become a grown-up, an adult... allow me to play you a lullaby as a present."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ann",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Got it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko paces up the steps. Ann sits below.\nTheir hearts beat. The clock ticks. The sounds gradually come into focus between them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Thump, thump.\nTick, tock."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko's fingers weave through keys of black and white.\nThe notes leap with the passage of time, giving sincerest blessings to the miracle of the girl's birth.\nThank you for coming into this land.\nMay the future hold happiness and joy for you.\nMay the child live forever in your heart.\nAs the final note settles, a church bell rings."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Happy birthday, Ann..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko turns to look at the girl, only to find she has fallen asleep at the table, her face the picture of peaceful slumber."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Happy birthday, Ann."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bena's in the church, waiting for Ann to wake up. Let's take a little stroll outside, shall we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Thank goodness you made it in the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm, it was close. Thank goodness indeed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What kind of dream did you... spin for her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A room of pure white, so clean it could not be real."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And in there, first things first, I inquired if she'd be willing to enter the dreamland I'd spun for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You <i>are</i> quite the noble lady, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Please do not take what Bena said at face value..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'You must have the child's permission before you enter their dreamland.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's a necessary procedure as ordained by the Castle of Dreams."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I see—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you talk about anything else with her, after that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In her dream, I told her how truly beautiful her words were, and that I hope she can continue to write."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whatever the style, whatever the story. It hardly has to be a fairytale, even."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes. That's what I wanted to tell her too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Before her eyes, I unveiled each and every character she'd penned."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mr. Decaytooth who loves to eat fruit, Miss Dolly who walks on her hands... And they all had a tea party together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How wonderful. If only Ann could stay in that dream forever..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dreams are not for wallowing in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No matter how sweet the dream, one has to wake up in the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even if reality is callous and chaotic?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You and Bena have such powerful Originium Arts..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sakiko, you misunderstand the power of fairytales and the Castle of Dreams. In the face of reality, what we can accomplish is so very limited."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It is but one thing. We nestle a seed deep in the depths of a child's heart."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Likely, it is what they considered the most important event, or thing, to them as children."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It usually lies quietly deep within. But at crucial moments—when people are at their weakest—it gives them strength."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Am I being a little too weighty, here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No. I saw the conviction in your eyes as you spoke."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sure the dream you spun for Ann will stay with her, and give her the courage to live in the days to come."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm. I believe so too, though my reason is a little different."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Before I spun her dream, I found in her heart a tiny seed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sweet dreams from the Castle are far from the only way to plant the seeds of faith—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's all thanks to you, Sakiko."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah, your piano was amazing!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I told you you'd be a killer musician. You need to get on stage at Rhodes Island's concerts!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh please, Vigna, spare me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As Vigna and Sakiko mock-fight, Iris draws an item out of a box."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mentioned having strange dreams, Sakiko?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Carry this necklace with you, and the nightmares should lessen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you... sure I should have this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just take it, honestly. It's nothing valuable. A little Arts-enchanted, that's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey—gimme one too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you also have nightmares?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I mean... probably maybe? I don't remember!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iris",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No. I can tell you've been a perfectly sound sleeper all your life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ughh—man, it's no fun dealing with you fairies! Nothing's secret from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As her colleagues chat, Sakiko carefully puts the necklace on.\nShe feels a gentle coolness at her neck, that then spreads through her entire body."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, how beautiful..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Iris, Vigna, look—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Nobody is there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Vigna?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Iris?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko looks around her.\nNobody is there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where... Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sakiko begins to make for the church she just left, every step more urgent than the last."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bena!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ann!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What...? Why am I back at Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Perplexed Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Miss Sakiko?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Perplexed Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are—are you—alright?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Turns around)—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "H-Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g1_rainystreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Uika Misumi",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's like how everything used to be... It's almost like we're dreaming."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ugh... a dream?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sakiko? Sakiko!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm... hmm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Vigna",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Time to get up, sleepyhead! It's a beautiful day."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's so cold..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My head hurts..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Saki... ko."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sa—ki—ko!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mmgh... where am I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g2_dreamcastlehall"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She is inside a massive castle.\nLooking up at the sky through the large window, she saw twin moons floating in the night sky."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g2_dreamcastlehall"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cold has cleared up her mind. She looks around her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Perplexed chirping)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W-What kind of creatures are these?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh my, did someone come to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sakiko Togawa",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The crisp sound of heels striking the ground rings out from the shadows.\nAnd thereupon a figure emerges, and slowly draws close to Sakiko.\nClack, clack."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
